s to be matched with the enemy's attack direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Juggle airborne enemies to create combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>gadgets</strong> and <strong>sigils</strong> from your companion to aid in combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/6492d257fe5f08a901458fcb49dded4e.poster.avif?t=1777537494\" width=950 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/6492d257fe5f08a901458fcb49dded4e.webm?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/6492d257fe5f08a901458fcb49dded4e.mp4?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where spirits prowl like wild beasts, a select few rise to the challenge of roaming the earth to defend the helpless. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented with the chance to venture into the spirit realm, Ao must go where no man has gone before and destroy spirits' access to humanity once and for all. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/40aae6a96a0834ae127be1bbb05a8674.poster.avif?t=1777537494\" width=950 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/40aae6a96a0834ae127be1bbb05a8674.webm?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4654740/extras/40aae6a96a0834ae127be1bbb05a8674.mp4?t=1777537494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\